{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Tnode.Prec_cell</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"arrayjit","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Ir","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Tnode","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Prec_cell","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>A node's delayed precision, sealed (gh-ocannl-1624) together with the storage precision it settles into: read with <code>get</code>, written only by the guarded <code>update_prec</code> / <code>update_infer_prec</code> -- which <a href=\"../index.html#val-update_prec\"><code>update_prec</code></a> and <a href=\"../index.html#val-update_infer_prec\"><code>update_infer_prec</code></a> wrap -- each write that changes the value reported to <a href=\"../index.html#val-prec_write_hook\"><code>prec_write_hook</code></a>. <code>storage</code> is the node's <a href=\"../index.html#type-t.storage_prec\"><code>storage_prec</code></a>, forced from the value; once it is forced, <code>update_prec</code> only validates and <code>update_infer_prec</code> refuses. The cell owns that lazy, so no caller can hand the guard a different one.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> t</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-sexp_of_t\"><a href=\"#val-sexp_of_t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> sexp_of_t : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Sexplib0</span>.Sexp.t</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-make\"><a href=\"#val-make\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> make : <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?stated</span>:<span><span><a href=\"../../Ops/index.html#type-prec\">Ops.prec</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.option</span> <a href=\"../../../Utils/Lazy/index.html#type-t\">Lazy.t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../index.html#type-delayed_prec\">delayed_prec</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>stated</code> is, for a node inferred bottom-up, the promotion of what its operands state (gh-ocannl-2028): <code>None</code> inside the lazy when no operand states a precision.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-get\"><a href=\"#val-get\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> get : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-delayed_prec\">delayed_prec</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-stated\"><a href=\"#val-stated\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> stated : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../../Ops/index.html#type-prec\">Ops.prec</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The precision something states for this cell: its specified precision, else what its operands state (<code>make</code>'s <code>stated</code>). <code>None</code> for a free cell: a top-down cell nothing specified, or a bottom-up cell none of whose operands, transitively, states a precision.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-storage\"><a href=\"#val-storage\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> storage : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../../Ops/index.html#type-prec\">Ops.prec</a> <a href=\"../../../Utils/Lazy/index.html#type-t\">Lazy.t</a></span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-update_prec\"><a href=\"#val-update_prec\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> update_prec : \u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?only_if</span>:<span>(<span><a href=\"../../Ops/index.html#type-prec\">Ops.prec</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.bool)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">name</span>:<span>(<span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../../Ops/index.html#type-prec\">Ops.prec</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.unit</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-update_infer_prec\"><a href=\"#val-update_infer_prec\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> update_infer_prec : \u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?only_if</span>:<span>(<span><a href=\"../../Ops/index.html#type-prec\">Ops.prec</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.bool)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">name</span>:<span>(<span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><a href=\"../../Ops/index.html#type-prec\">Ops.prec</a> <a href=\"../../../Utils/Lazy/index.html#type-t\">Lazy.t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.unit</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-follow\"><a href=\"#val-follow\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> follow : \u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?only_if</span>:<span>(<span><a href=\"../../Ops/index.html#type-prec\">Ops.prec</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.bool)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">name</span>:<span>(<span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><a href=\"../../Ops/index.html#type-prec\">Ops.prec</a> <a href=\"../../../Utils/Lazy/index.html#type-t\">Lazy.t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>update_infer_prec</code> for a link whose target may itself be inferred from readers of this cell (gh-ocannl-1967: an initializer's node following its parameter). The cell keeps the precision it would have settled into without the link, which is what <a href=\"#val-bottom_up\"><code>bottom_up</code></a> then answers, so the link closes no cycle through a bottom-up reader.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-follow_if_free\"><a href=\"#val-follow_if_free\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> follow_if_free : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">name</span>:<span>(<span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><a href=\"../../Ops/index.html#type-prec\">Ops.prec</a> <a href=\"../../../Utils/Lazy/index.html#type-t\">Lazy.t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>follow</code> of a float cell by a consumer's precision, which the cell takes only if it is free (<a href=\"#val-stated\"><code>stated</code></a> is <code>None</code>) and the consumer's precision is a float, both decided when the cell settles (gh-ocannl-2028); otherwise the link promotes by the cell's own value, changing nothing.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-bottom_up\"><a href=\"#val-bottom_up\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> bottom_up : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../../Ops/index.html#type-prec\">Ops.prec</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The precision a consumer promoting from its operands reads: the storage precision, except for a cell that <a href=\"#val-follow\"><code>follow</code></a>s another and holds no specified precision, which answers the precision it had before the link. Forces what it answers.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-snapshot\"><a href=\"#type-snapshot\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> snapshot</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The cell's value at a checkpoint, bound to the cell (gh-ocannl-903).</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-snapshot\"><a href=\"#val-snapshot\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> snapshot : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-snapshot\">snapshot</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-restore\"><a href=\"#val-restore\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> restore : <span><a href=\"#type-snapshot\">snapshot</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Puts the recorded value back, as a counted write.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-settling_began_since\"><a href=\"#val-settling_began_since\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> settling_began_since : <span><a href=\"#type-snapshot\">snapshot</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Whether forcing the cell's storage began after the snapshot -- returned or raised: either way its lazy is memoized, and no rewind can reset it.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-snapshot_changed\"><a href=\"#val-snapshot_changed\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> snapshot_changed : <span><a href=\"#type-snapshot\">snapshot</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Whether the value differs (physically) from the recorded one: a diagnostic.</p></div></div>"}